<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>2026 Data</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-1: #07111f;
        --bg-2: #0e1d33;
        --panel: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
        --panel-strong: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96);
        --card: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
        --line: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
        --text: #e5eefb;
        --muted: #9bb2cf;
        --primary: #7c9dff;
        --primary-2: #5eead4;
        --accent: #f59e0b;
        --shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }

      html, body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100%;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(124, 157, 255, 0.2), transparent 33%),
          radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(94, 234, 212, 0.12), transparent 26%),
          linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-1), var(--bg-2));
        color: var(--text);
      }

      body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 28px 28px 48px;
      }

      .page-shell {
        max-width: 1380px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .topbar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 18px 22px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 20px;
        background: rgba(9, 16, 29, 0.55);
        backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .brand {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 42px;
        height: 42px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-2));
        color: #04111f;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(124, 157, 255, 0.4);
      }

      nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 28px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      nav a {
        color: var(--muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.2s ease;
      }

      nav a:hover {
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .ghost-btn,
      .primary-btn,
      .secondary-btn {
        appearance: none;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-weight: 700;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
      }

      .ghost-btn {
        padding: 12px 18px;
        background: rgba(124, 157, 255, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(124, 157, 255, 0.25);
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .primary-btn {
        padding: 15px 26px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #a78bfa);
        color: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(124, 157, 255, 0.35);
      }

      .secondary-btn {
        padding: 15px 26px;
        background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .ghost-btn:hover,
      .primary-btn:hover,
      .secondary-btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }

      .hero {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.12fr 0.88fr;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 36px;
        padding: 54px 16px 26px;
      }

      .hero-copy {
        padding-right: 10px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        width: fit-content;
        padding: 8px 12px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(94, 234, 212, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(94, 234, 212, 0.2);
        color: var(--primary-2);
        font-size: 0.76rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 22px 0 18px;
        font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 3vw + 1.4rem, 5rem);
        line-height: 1.02;
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      }

      h1 span {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dfe9ff, #77f7df);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
      }

      .hero-copy p {
        max-width: 620px;
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .cta-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-top: 28px;
      }

      .stats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(120px, 1fr));
        gap: 18px;
        margin-top: 38px;
      }

      .stat-card {
        padding: 18px 16px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 18px;
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
      }

      .stat-card strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .stat-card span {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 6px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.86rem;
      }

      .hero-panel {
        position: relative;
      }

      .panel-shell {
        position: relative;
        padding: 16px;
        border-radius: 28px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.82), rgba(9, 17, 31, 0.92));
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .panel-badge {
        position: absolute;
        top: -10px;
        left: 24px;
        z-index: 2;
        padding: 9px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-2));
        color: #061320;
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .chat-window {
        overflow: hidden;
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 620px;
        border-radius: 22px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.14);
        background: rgba(8, 12, 20, 0.9);
      }

      .chat-window iframe {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: 620px;
        border: 0;
        background: #0b1220;
      }

      .feature-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 22px;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }

      .feature-card {
        padding: 24px 22px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 22px;
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
      }

      .feature-icon {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 52px;
        height: 52px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124, 157, 255, 0.18), rgba(94, 234, 212, 0.18));
        font-size: 1.4rem;
      }

      .feature-card h3 {
        margin: 18px 0 10px;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .feature-card p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      @media (max-width: 980px) {
        body {
          padding: 18px 16px 32px;
        }

        .topbar {
          flex-wrap: wrap;
          justify-content: center;
        }

        nav {
          order: 3;
          width: 100%;
          justify-content: center;
          flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .hero {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          padding-top: 38px;
        }

        .feature-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 560px) {
        .cta-row,
        .stats {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          display: grid;
        }

        .cta-row {
          gap: 12px;
        }

        .primary-btn,
        .secondary-btn,
        .ghost-btn {
          width: 100%;
        }

        .chat-window,
        .chat-window iframe {
          min-height: 520px;
          height: 520px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page-shell">
      <header class="topbar">
        <div class="brand">
          <span class="brand-mark">2026</span>
          <span>Data</span>
        </div>

        <nav aria-label="메인 메뉴">
          <a href="#services">서비스</a>
          <a href="#solutions">솔루션</a>
          <a href="#insights">인사이트</a>
          <a href="#contact">문의</a>
        </nav>

        <button class="ghost-btn" type="button">문의하기</button>
      </header>

      <main class="hero">
        <section class="hero-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">AI Data Partner</span>
          <h1>데이터로 더 빠르게<br /><span>성장하는 미래</span></h1>
          <p>
            2026 Data는 데이터를 분석하고, 비즈니스 인사이트를 도출하며,
            고객 경험을 개선하는 AI 기반 데이터 솔루션을 제공합니다.
            지금 바로 AI 챗봇을 통해 실시간 상담과 맞춤형 가이드를 받아보세요.
          </p>

          <div class="cta-row">
            <button class="primary-btn" type="button">무료 상담 신청</button>
            <button class="secondary-btn" type="button">서비스 보기</button>
          </div>

          <div class="stats" aria-label="핵심 지표">
            <div class="stat-card">
              <strong>24/7</strong>
              <span>자동 응답</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
              <strong>98%</strong>
              <span>문의 해결률</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
              <strong>3x</strong>
              <span>효율 개선</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="hero-panel" aria-label="AI 챗봇 상담">
          <div class="panel-shell">
            <div class="panel-badge">AI Chat</div>
            <div class="chat-window">
              <iframe
                src="https://copilotstudio.microsoft.com/environments/Default-bc52be20-d18a-4e38-a913-eec0a4df586e/bots/cre2b_bot_rg3HN4/webchat?__version__=2&enableFileAttachment=false&cliAgent=true"
                title="2026 Data AI 챗봇"
                allow="microphone; camera; geolocation"
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>

      <section class="feature-grid" id="services">
        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
          <h3>데이터 분석</h3>
          <p>
            기업의 데이터를 정리하고 유의미한 패턴을 발견해
            더 나은 의사결정에 필요한 인사이트를 제공합니다.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🤖</div>
          <h3>AI 자동화</h3>
          <p>
            반복적인 업무를 자동화하고 고객 응대 시간을 단축해
            운영 효율성을 높여드립니다.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🚀</div>
          <h3>성장 전략</h3>
          <p>
            트렌드 기반의 전략 수립과 실험 중심의 실행 계획으로
            지속 가능한 성장을 지원합니다.
          </p>
        </article>
      </section>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
